Asha says 'Goodnight'.
She goes to her own home.
Now I am alone here.
I sit on the comfortable sofa.
I look at my new home.
All the things are in their proper places.
Near the desk is a chair.
The computer is placed on the desk.
Under the bed is my suitcase.
My clothes are in the cupboard.
Everything is arranged well.
Today I am very tired.
But in my mind, there is great satisfaction.
In Mumbai, this is my own home.
There is a lot of peace here.
I am very happy.
